# Wallet (KEEP PRIVATE — never commit, never paste into a chat or an issue)
#
# `local` needs neither of these: it falls back to the pre-funded devnet seed.
# For preprod/preview set exactly ONE.
#
# Paste the 24 words from IAM/Lace between the quotes, on one line:
# WALLET_MNEMONIC="word1 word2 word3 ... word24"
#
# Or a 64-character hex master seed:
# WALLET_SEED=91e0e3be213ccfd53f894b4e8b4855b99eb8e41d6160f8de2f6d03544a68f691

# Contract Configuration
CONTRACT_NAME=payroll
