# Treasury destinations for withheld money.
#
# Frozen into every payroll contract at deploy and never changeable afterwards,
# so these are decided once. The COIN KEYS are what deploy-tax.ts reads; they
# are public and safe to share.
#
# The SEEDS are the only way back to these wallets — needed to check what the
# treasuries received (`npm run payee <seed> -- --balance`) and to spend it.
# Generated 2026-08-20 with `npm run payee`.
